{
  "_comment": [
    "ETH Cali swag catalogue — the single seed for the chain (scs-ethcali/scripts/seed-swag.ts),",
    "Supabase (swag_products / swag_variants) and Shopify (wallet_ethcali/scripts/shopify-sync.mjs).",
    "Once seeded, Supabase is the live source of truth; this file is the bootstrap and the review diff.",
    "",
    "One product = one Swag1155 collection per chain. Each variant = one design = one tokenId,",
    "in array order (tokenId = index + 1). Append new designs at the end; never reorder or delete.",
    "Size is NOT on chain: it is a Shopify variant option captured on the order.",
    "",
    "Prices are human-readable USD, parsed with USDC's 6 decimals by the seeder. COP follows the",
    "live TRM rate (app) or a daily push (Shopify). USDC is the only on-chain token at launch.",
    "Stock decided 2026-09-23: 5 per design; prices revised 2026-09-23 to cap 15 / mug 10 / tee 30 / hoodie 50 USD, 1 sold on chain via buy(), 4 via Shopify vouchers.",
    "Caps can be raised later, never lowered below what has been minted.",
    "",
    "imageCid / metadataCid are filled by wallet_ethcali/scripts/swag-pin.mjs. The seeder refuses",
    "to run while any metadataURI is still ipfs://PENDING.",
    "",
    "prices.USDC is the ON-CHAIN price and already carries usdcDiscountPct off priceUsd (the card/list price).",
    "Change priceUsd, re-run the discount, then scripts/sync-swag-onchain.ts."
  ],
